Source: omaxian-firstboot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Marcello Palmitessa <marcello@omaxian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: omaxian-firstboot
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, curl, jq, flatpak, ca-certificates
Description: Omaxian OS first-boot provisioning
 sysvinit service that, on an installed system with network access, adds
 Flathub, installs the Omaxian Flatpak set and downloads fresh AppImages
 (manifest of upstream URLs), including the optional "extra apps"
 picked in the installer. A per-user first-login step integrates the
 AppImages with Gear Lever and seeds ~/.config/openra from the offline payload.
